<headline>Hogs purchased for slaughter - USDA. [CORRECTED 01:30 GMT 12/3]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hogs purchased for slaughter; five markets combined include Omaha, Sioux City, St Joseph.</p>
